run - timeline rendering (the trace of a run to t = 6)

RunTimeline::mission.controller.modes
  0 .. 1  waiting | charged
  1 .. 2  acknowledged | charged (time, accept Ack)  via sending
  2 .. 3  waiting | charged (time)
  3 .. 4  acknowledged | charged (time, accept Ack)  via sending
  4 .. 5  waiting | charged (time)
  5 .. 6  acknowledged | charged (time, accept Ack)  via sending
  6 .. 6  waiting | charged (time)  (held at the end)
  transitions:
    t=1 waiting -> sending (time)
    t=1 sending -> acknowledged (accept Ack)
    t=2 acknowledged -> waiting (time)
    t=3 waiting -> sending (time)
    t=3 sending -> acknowledged (accept Ack)
    t=4 acknowledged -> waiting (time)
    t=5 waiting -> sending (time)
    t=5 sending -> acknowledged (accept Ack)
    t=6 acknowledged -> waiting (time)
  noted:
    t=0 choice entering modes: next waiting(entry), charged(entry) (unordered; took waiting(entry) first)

RunTimeline::mission.instrument.modes
  0 .. 1    waiting
  1 .. 2.5  acknowledged (accept Ping)
  2.5 .. 3  waiting (time)
  3 .. 4.5  acknowledged (accept Ping)
  4.5 .. 5  waiting (time)
  5 .. 6    acknowledged (accept Ping)  (held at the end)
  transitions:
    t=1 waiting -> acknowledged (accept Ping)
    t=2.5 acknowledged -> waiting (time)
    t=3 waiting -> acknowledged (accept Ping)
    t=4.5 acknowledged -> waiting (time)
    t=5 waiting -> acknowledged (accept Ping)
